      "words": "bear, stand, endure",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "这三个词都有“忍受”的意思，常可以通用，都可以与 can 连用。用于疑问句或否定句时，表示不忍、不愿，但 "
            },
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "endure"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 一般只用于非常严重的情况，指长时间忍受痛苦。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "I can’t "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "bear"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " your nagging. 我受不了你的唠叨。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "I can "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "stand"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " a certain amount of foolery. 一定限度的愚蠢行为我尚能容忍。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "She had "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "endured"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " great pain for several years. 她忍受极大的痛苦已有好多年了。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
